<h1>Localiser Menu Operation - Calibrate</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p>Call this command from <span style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic;"><i><b>System &gt; Localiser Menu Operation &gt; Calibrate</b></i></span>. The following wizard will appear (pictures depend on the current localiser):</p>
<p class="stepstitle">Step 1</p>
<p>Set the first position then press the left pedal (A button) to continue or press right pedal (B button) to cancel.</p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example for MM Z with FARO/CimCore</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP166004144" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="Images/localiser_menu_op1.png" width="364px" height="477px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
</div>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a2" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example for MM D/C with FARO/CimCore</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP164628199" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="Images/Calibrate_MMD_1.png" width="362px" height="474px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></p>
</div>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a6" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example for MM Z with K-Scan</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP162584318" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="Images/Calibrate_KScan_1.gif" width="315px" height="544px" border="0" class="img_whs6" alt=""></p>
</div>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="stepstitle">Step 2</p>
<p>Set the second position by moving the sensor upwards and then pressing the left pedal (A button) to confirm or right pedal (B button) to cancel.</p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a3" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example for MM Z with FARO/CimCore</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP164746275" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="Images/localiser_menu_op2.png" width="362px" height="474px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></p>
</div>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a7" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example for MM D/C with FARO/CimCore</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP163874932" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="Images/Calibrate_MMD_2.png" width="362px" height="474px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></p>
</div>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a4" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example for MM Z with K-Scan</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP163983323" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="Images/Calibrate_KScan_2.gif" width="315px" height="544px" border="0" class="img_whs6" alt=""></p>
</div>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="stepstitle">Step 3</p>
<p>If the orientation was calculated successfully, you should see the following dialog. Press the left pedal (A button) to confirm or right pedal (B button to cancel).</p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a5" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP164923158" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="Images/localiser_menu_op3.png" width="362px" height="474px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></p>
</div>
